      "t": "Here is a French learning adaptation of episode five of Call My Agent. Julie Gayet and JoeyStarr are acting in an eighteenth-century costume film, but their argument is stopping the shoot. Their agents, Andrea and Gabriel, will have to help. Listen to the French first; you do not need to catch every word.",
